    "opening-001": {
      "id": "opening-001",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "李贤家里一直没有很多钱。",
        "english": "Lee Hyun's family has not had much money for a long time.",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-sell-old-account-s01"
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "family-room-late",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "opening-002"
    },
    "opening-002": {
      "id": "opening-002",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "白天，他在加油站工作。",
        "english": "During the day, he works at a gas station.",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-sell-old-account-s02"
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "gas-station-night",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "opening-003"
    },
    "opening-003": {
      "id": "opening-003",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "晚上，他回家以后，还要照顾奶奶和妹妹。",
        "english": "At night, after he goes home, he still has to take care of his grandma and younger sister.",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-sell-old-account-s03"
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "family-room-late",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "opening-004"
    },
    "opening-004": {
      "id": "opening-004",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "妹妹虽然不说，可是李贤看得出来，她每天都在担心家里的钱。",
        "english": "His younger sister does not say it, but Lee Hyun can tell that she worries about the family's money every day.",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-sell-old-account-s05"
      },
      "nextId": "opening-005"
    },
    "opening-005": {
      "id": "opening-005",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "李贤自己也很急，可是他不喜欢把“我很难”放在脸上。",
        "english": "Lee Hyun is worried too, but he does not like to show how hard things are on his face.",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-sell-old-account-s06"
      },
      "nextId": "opening-006"
    },
    "opening-006": {
      "id": "opening-006",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "他还有一个旧游戏账号。",
        "english": "He still has an old game account.",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-sell-old-account-s08"
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "account-sale-screen",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "opening-007"
    },
    "opening-007": {
      "id": "opening-007",
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "chinese": "他为什么要卖掉旧账号？",
        "english": "Why does he need to sell the old account?"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "family-bills",
          "kind": "memory",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "为了家里的账单和生活费。",
            "english": "For family bills and living costs."
          },
          "nextId": "opening-008"
        },
        {
          "id": "pride",
          "kind": "memory",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "因为他想证明自己很厉害。",
            "english": "Because he wants to prove he is impressive."
          },
          "nextId": "opening-009"
        },
        {
          "id": "easy-profit",
          "kind": "memory",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "因为赚钱很容易。",
            "english": "Because making money is easy."
          },
          "nextId": "opening-009"
        }
      ]
    },
    "opening-008": {
      "id": "opening-008",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "对。旧账号不是回忆，是奶奶的药费和妹妹的学费。",
        "english": "Right. The old account is not nostalgia; it is medicine for Grandma and school money for his sister."
      },
      "nextId": "opening-010"
    },
    "opening-009": {
      "id": "opening-009",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "不完全对。李贤不卖骄傲，也不相信轻松的钱。他卖的是自己舍不得的时间。",
        "english": "Not quite. Lee Hyun is not selling pride, and he does not believe in easy money. He is selling time he did not want to lose."
      },
      "nextId": "opening-010"
    },
    "opening-010": {
      "id": "opening-010",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "那天晚上，李贤比平常更晚回家。",
        "english": "That night, Lee Hyun comes home later than usual.",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-hide-tired-hands-s01"
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "real-apartment-night",
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "lee-hyun",
            "personaId": "real-world",
            "spriteId": "lee-hyun-real-sitting-exhausted",
            "position": "left",
            "xPercent": 34,
            "scale": 0.82,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "opening-011"
    },
    "opening-011": {
      "id": "opening-011",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "他一开门，就先把手放到背后。",
        "english": "As soon as he opens the door, he puts his hands behind his back.",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-hide-tired-hands-s02"
      },
      "nextId": "opening-012"
    },
    "opening-012": {
      "id": "opening-012",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "妹妹马上看了他一眼。",
        "english": "His younger sister looks at him right away.",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-hide-tired-hands-s03"
      },
      "nextId": "opening-013"
    },
    "opening-013": {
      "id": "opening-013",
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "chinese": "李贤要怎么回答？",
        "english": "How should Lee Hyun answer?"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "joke",
          "kind": "expressive",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "笑一下，说自己只是和箱子打架。",
            "english": "Smile and say he only fought some boxes."
          },
          "nextId": "opening-014"
        },
        {
          "id": "quiet",
          "kind": "expressive",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "安静一点，只说今天有点累。",
            "english": "Answer quietly that today was a little tiring."
          },
          "nextId": "opening-015"
        }
      ]
    },
    "opening-014": {
      "id": "opening-014",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "李贤笑着说：“我回来了。”",
        "english": "Lee Hyun smiles and says, 'I'm home.'",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-hide-tired-hands-s04"
      },
      "scene": {
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "lee-hyun",
            "personaId": "real-world",
            "spriteId": "lee-hyun-real-forced-smile",
            "position": "right",
            "xPercent": 58,
            "scale": 0.82,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "opening-016"
    },
    "opening-015": {
      "id": "opening-015",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "他把声音放轻，只说：“今天有点累，但没事。”",
        "english": "He softens his voice and says only, 'Today was a little tiring, but it's okay.'"
      },
      "nextId": "opening-016",
      "scene": {
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "lee-hyun",
            "personaId": "real-world",
            "spriteId": "lee-hyun-real-sitting-exhausted",
            "position": "left",
            "xPercent": 34,
            "scale": 0.82,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "opening-016": {
      "id": "opening-016",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "她只问：“今天很累吗？”",
        "english": "She only asks, 'Was today very tiring?'",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-hide-tired-hands-s06"
      },
      "nextId": "opening-017"
    },
    "opening-017": {
      "id": "opening-017",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "李贤还是说：“没事。”",
        "english": "Lee Hyun still says, 'It's okay.'",
        "readerSentenceId": "b01c01-hide-tired-hands-s07"
      },
      "nextId": "opening-018"
    },
    "opening-018": {
      "id": "opening-018",
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "chinese": "旧头盔亮起来，皇家之路在黑暗里等他。",
        "english": "The old headset glows. Royal Road waits for him in the dark."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "hesitate",
          "kind": "expressive",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "先停一下，记住现实的重量。",
            "english": "Pause and remember the weight of reality."
          },
          "nextId": "opening-019"
        },
        {
          "id": "enter",
          "kind": "expressive",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "直接进入。不能浪费时间。",
            "english": "Enter directly. No time can be wasted."
          },
          "nextId": "opening-020"
        }
      ]
    },
    "opening-019": {
      "id": "opening-019",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "他停了一秒。不是因为害怕，而是因为身后还有家人。",
        "english": "He pauses for one second. Not because he is afraid, but because his family is behind him."
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "royal-road-login",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "opening-021"
    },
    "opening-020": {
      "id": "opening-020",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "他立刻按下确认。穷人的犹豫，也要算成本。",
        "english": "He confirms at once. Even hesitation has a cost when you are poor."
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "royal-road-login",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "opening-021"
    },
